---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
import heroBg from '../../assets/brand/hero-bg.jpg';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<section class="relative isolate flex min-h-[38rem] items-center overflow-hidden bg-black pt-20 text-white lg:min-h-[44rem]">
  <Image src={heroBg} alt="" widths={[800, 1400, 2000]} sizes="100vw" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 size-full object-cover opacity-80" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/40 via-black/30 to-black/70"></div>

  <div class="container-zava py-20 text-center">
    <h1 class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-4xl leading-[1.1] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl">
      Marketing 360° que <span class="text-orange">transforma</span> estratégias em vendas
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base text-white/85 sm:text-lg">
      Muito além das redes sociais: criamos estratégias completas de marketing que geram resultados reais para o seu negócio.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:gap-8">
      <Button href="/contato/" variant="outline-light">Pedir proposta</Button>
      <a href={site.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-white/90 underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange hover:underline">
        Falar com um especialista
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
